{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","翠绿之槛"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Threshold of Jade"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤寄生草地，范围内的敌人无法移动并被吸收生命值和损失能量，期间达赫妮婆婆免疫控制效果。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie summons Parasitic Grass to immobilize the enemies in range, absorb their HP and reduce their Energy. She is immune to control effects during the effect."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在自身周围2格范围内召唤寄生草地，持续3秒，寄生草地范围内的敌军无法行动，每秒失去25 + 5点能量。范围内的所有敌军每秒还会失去总计130% ATK的生命值，并且每个敌军至少失去60% ATK生命值，达赫妮婆婆自身会回复等量的生命值。技能持续期间达赫妮婆婆处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie summons Parasitic Grass within 2 tiles for 3s. Every second, enemies within range cannot move or act and lose 25 + 5 Energy and at least 60% ATK HP. The total amount of their lost HP is 130% ATK. Granny Dahnie also recovers an equal amount of HP. She is unaffected while Parasitic Grass exists."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":126,"end":130,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":90,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":131,"end":133,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":151,"end":158,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":200,"end":208,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":268,"end":278,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","范围内所有敌军每秒总计失去的生命值提升至140% ATK，并且每个敌人至少失去的生命值提升至65% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","The total amount of enemies' lost HP is increased to 140% ATK per second, and each enemy's minimum HP loss is increased to 65% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":123,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","范围内敌军每秒失去的能量提升至35 + 5点。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","The Energy loss per second of enemies in range is increased to 35 + 5."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":65,"end":69,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","范围内所有敌军每秒总计失去的生命值提升至150% ATK，并且每个敌人至少失去的生命值提升至70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","The total amount of enemies' lost HP is increased to 150% ATK per second, and each enemy's minimum HP loss is increased to 70% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":123,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","范围内所有敌军每秒总计失去的生命值提升至160% ATK，并且每个敌人至少失去的生命值提升至75% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","The total amount of enemies' lost HP is increased to 160% ATK per second, and each enemy's minimum HP loss is increased to 75% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":123,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","种子炮弹"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Seed Cannon"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","敌人持续对达赫妮婆婆造成伤害时，向其发射寄生种子降低其急速。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","When any enemy deals a certain amount of total damage to Granny Dahnie, she attacks them back with Parasitic Seeds, reducing their Haste."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","任一敌人累计对达赫妮婆婆造成最大生命值15%的伤害后，达赫妮婆婆会使用盾牌对其发射寄生种子，造成120% + 15% ATK伤害，降低其40点急速，持续6秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When an enemy deals total damage equal to 15% of Granny Dahnie's max HP to her, Granny Dahnie shoots Parasitic Seeds at this enemy, dealing 120% + 15% ATK damage and reducing their Haste by 40 for 6s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":144,"end":150,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":140,"end":154,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","降低急速提升至50点。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Reduces the enemy's Haste by 50."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","降低急速提升至55点。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Reduces the enemy's Haste by 55."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","降低急速提升至60点。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Reduces the enemy's Haste by 60."],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","愤怒之讽"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Angry Taunt"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","嘲讽一个敌军，同时恢复生命值。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie taunts an enemy and recovers HP."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","嘲讽一个敌军，持续3秒，同时立刻恢复140% + 15% ATK生命值。该技能会优先对正在攻击最虚弱的友军的敌人使用。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie taunts an enemy for 3s and instantly recovers 140% + 15% ATK HP. This skill prioritizes the enemy who targets the weakest ally."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":64,"end":70,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":0,"end":2,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"},{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":47,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":14,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"},{"start":60,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":128,"end":135,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie recovers150% + 15% ATK HP."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":22,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至160% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie recovers160% + 15% ATK HP."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":22,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至170% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie recovers170% + 15% ATK HP."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":22,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身受愈，释放“翠绿之槛”期间进一步提升受愈。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie's Vitality increases during battle. She gains extra Vitality while casting Threshold of Jade."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高11点受愈。且当释放“翠绿之槛”期间，额外提升3点受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie increases her Vitality by 11 during battle. She gains an extra 3 Vitality while casting Threshold of Jade."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点受愈。且当释放“翠绿之槛”期间，额外提升4点受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie increases her Vitality by 15 during battle. She gains an extra 4 Vitality while casting Threshold of Jade."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高19点受愈。且当释放“翠绿之槛”期间，额外提升5点受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie increases her Vitality by 19 during battle. She gains an extra 5 Vitality while casting Threshold of Jade."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","花王祝祷"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Glimmerbloom Blessings"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","生命值低时，大幅提升自身护甲和魔抗，并持续恢复生命值。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","When Granny Dahnie's HP is low, she gains Phys DEF, Magic DEF, and recovers HP."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","生命值低于50%时，荧荧花盾牌快速成长，自身护甲提升50%，魔抗提升50%，且每秒恢复100% ATK生命值，持续12秒，每场战斗最多使用一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When Granny Dahnie's HP ratio is lower than 50%, the Glimmerbloom Shield grows bigger, increasing her Phys DEF by 50% and Magic DEF by 50% and recovering 100% ATK HP every second. The skill lasts 12s and can be cast once every battle."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":154,"end":162,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","持续期间每秒恢复生命值提升至105% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Recovers 105% ATK HP every second."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":9,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","持续期间自身处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Gains unaffected when skill takes effect."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":6,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","持续期间每秒恢复生命值提升至110% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Recovers 110% ATK HP every second."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":9,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“种子炮弹”发射种子立即恢复生命值。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie recovers HP when shooting seeds using Seed Cannon."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“种子炮弹”发射种子时立刻恢复120% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Granny Dahnie recovers 120% ATK HP when shooting seeds using Seed Cannon."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","释放“种子炮弹”时，立即回复100点能量，在技能动作期间自身急速提高150点，且敌人受到该技能发射的寄生种子影响时额外降低70%的攻击力。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Shooting a Parasitic Seed instantly restores Granny Dahnie's Energy by 100. While shooting the Parasitic Seed, Granny Dahnie's Haste increases by 150, and the ATK reduction the seed inflicts on enemies is further increased by 70%."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","荧荧花的友谊"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Bloom's Boon"]]}